WEBVTT

00:00:00.673 --> 00:00:06.376
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Experts agree that getting up early is a big help if you have a lot of things to do.

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:08.982
There are three main reasons for this.

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:14.770
The first reason why it’s good to get up early is that the early morning is quiet.

00:00:15.374 --> 00:00:17.624
Nobody phones you at 6.00 a.m.

00:00:18.312 --> 00:00:21.887
There aren’t any important emails or messages to answer.

00:00:22.403 --> 00:00:23.889
There aren’t any meetings.

00:00:24.147 --> 00:00:25.386
There aren’t any people.

00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:27.959
The morning is your time.

00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:33.860
The second reason is that if you get up early, you go to bed early.

00:00:34.285 --> 00:00:37.741
Most people don’t do anything useful in the evenings.

00:00:38.105 --> 00:00:43.006
People who go to bed late spend many hours watching TV,

00:00:43.196 --> 00:00:47.480
seeing their friends, and spending time on social media.

00:00:47.865 --> 00:00:52.398
So if you want to do a lot, it’s better to go to bed early,

00:00:52.575 --> 00:00:55.847
and have shorter evenings and longer mornings.

00:00:56.777 --> 00:01:02.002
The third reason is that it’s better to do things in the morning, when you have energy.

00:01:02.607 --> 00:01:06.679
Most people are tired after a day at work or college.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:12.221
And when you’re tired, the last thing you want to do is to exercise,

00:01:12.265 --> 00:01:15.870
or to study, or to practise a musical instrument.

00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:19.467
And if you find it impossible to get up early?

00:01:19.933 --> 00:01:24.197
Set your alarm five minutes earlier than you usually get up.

00:01:24.594 --> 00:01:28.141
And the next day set it five minutes earlier again.

00:01:28.732 --> 00:01:33.711
After three weeks you’ll have nearly two hours that you never had before!